# Generated request-flow docs are always written with LF by
# scripts/dataflow/*.mjs. Pin them to LF so local (Windows, core.autocrlf=true)
# regeneration is a no-op instead of showing spurious CRLF churn in `git status`.
# CI runs on Linux (LF) and is unaffected either way.
apps/**/DATAFLOW.md text eol=lf
# The hosted interactive dataflow site (served via GitHub Pages under catalog/).
catalog/dataflow/**.html text eol=lf
